<title>UK: Ennstone may bid for Bruntcliffe.</title>
<headline>Ennstone may bid for Bruntcliffe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ennstone Plc said on Thursday that it was in the early stages of talks that might lead to an offer being made for Bruntcliffe Aggregates Plc.  </p>
<p>Ennstone, which is engaged in the quarrying and manufacture of stone products for the building industry, said it bought share representing 9.37 percent of Bruntcliffe on July 25.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
